# Copy to secret_internal_api.env in this same folder and fill in a real
# value - generate one with:
#   python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"
#
# The same value as chat_app's, ai_agent's and ember_api's
# secret_internal_api.env. When set, every request to /mcp must carry it
# (X-Internal-Token), and POST /upload always does. There's no human login
# on these calls, so it is the entire authorization - treat it like a
# password.
INTERNAL_API_TOKEN=
